      <node concept="Xl_RD" id="5NJc6w6H$iK" role="33vP2m">
        <property role="Xl_RC" value="[generic] adds or deletes a dependency between two MPS modules. ADD is an upsert: re-adding an existing edge updates its scope/reexport in place. If the target is already supplied by a used DevKit, ADD is a no-op and reports providedByDevKit. Extends scope routes to the source module's extendedLanguages/depGenerators/extendedDevkits collection depending on its kind (Language/Generator/DevKit); other source kinds reject Extends. DELETE probes both the regular dependency list and the per-kind Extends collection." />
      </node>
      <node concept="3Tm6S6" id="5NJc6w6H$iL" role="1B3o_S" />
