      <node concept="Xl_RD" id="5NJc6w6H$jG" role="33vP2m">
        <property role="Xl_RC" value="[generic] queries MPS language structure. IS_SUBCONCEPT_OF (concept, superConcept), GET_ALL_SUPERCONCEPTS (concept), GET_SUB_CONCEPTS (concept, optional direct) check inheritance. GET_ASSIGNABLE_CONCEPTS and GET_ASSIGNABLE_REFERENCES (parentConcept, role) list non-abstract concepts assignable to a containment/reference role. GET_ENUMERATION_LITERALS (concept, propertyName) lists an enum property's literals. LIST_CONCEPT_ASPECTS (concept) lists the aspect models present in the concept's language. IS_SMART_REFERENCE (parentConcept, role) checks whether a reference role's target concept implements ISmartReferent." />
