      </node>
      <node concept="Xl_RD" id="5NJc6w6DLJE" role="33vP2m">
        <property role="Xl_RC" value="[generic] generates a default ConceptEditorDeclaration, or an EditorComponentDeclaration when type=\&quot;component\&quot;, for a concept, wiring properties, children and references to default cell models. If the target concept is uncompiled or its structure is out of date, this tool first attempts to build (make) the structure model; if that build fails, or the language runtime remains stale or hollow, the operation fails with a recovery hint. A concept with a smart reference link gets a single reference cell and cannot also include editor components. A concept that produces no cells and has no structural content of its own is scaffolded as a marker: an editable empty cell plus a default SubstituteMenu, so MPS drives substitution from the surrounding slot. On failure the partially created editor and menu are rolled back and the model is left untouched on disk. port note: insert runs as an undoable command on the EDT, matching upstream." />
      </node>
      <node concept="3Tm6S6" id="5NJc6w6DLJF" role="1B3o_S" />
    </node>
